# =====================================================================
# Release V028 -- reclassify nhs_uda_completion_rate as a 'within' metric
# =====================================================================
# NHS UDA delivery is NOT higher-is-better. 95% is the target, the NHS does not
# penalise 95%+, and OVER-delivery (>100%) is unpaid work. The metric was wrongly
# defined Range_Type='above' (higher better); it should be 'within' (deviation from
# target band, like exam_ratio). Re-seeds Config.Metric_Definitions (idempotent
# MERGE/DELETE+INSERT). Metadata only -- no reload, no re-baseline. The card colouring
# (NHS UDA Completion Rate BG) is handled in TabularEditor_NHS.csx (within band).
#
# Run: .\Scripts\Deploy.ps1 -Manifest Releases\V028__nhs_completion_rate_within.manifest
#      (set $env:FABRIC_SERVER for prod)
# =====================================================================

DEPLOY  Fabric\Config.Metric_Definitions.Data.sql
